Gugs, like ghasts and ghouls, come from H.P. Lovecraft's book _The
Dream-Quest of Unknown Kadath_.  From my memory of the book, gugs are mute
one-eyed giants that like to eat ghasts. Their mouths also open from left
to right instead of top to bottom.

